extraction_notes: "WB9 South America 2 printed 142-144 (cache p142-p144, page_offset 0); the introduction starts at the foot of 142, the stat block and abilities are on 143, the rest on 144. The OCR reads I.Q. as [.Q. on 143; the attribute line otherwise reads cleanly. No mutant-capybara class was in production on 2026-09-25. || XP: the Condoroid, Falconoid and Achilles Mutant Capybara ladder on printed 192, read off a render, as briefed; the book prints a ladder for the race and the R.C.C. is played on its own, so it is stored. || ATTRIBUTES as printed: I.Q. 3D6+3, M.E. 3D6+8, M.A. 3D6+6, P.S. 3D6+4, P.P. 3D6, P.E. 2D6+8, P.B. 2D6, Spd 3D6 running (1D4x10 swimming is a natural ability). || POOLS: S.D.C. 2D6x10 ''plus skill and O.C.C. bonuses'' - the wording of a racial pool that adds to an occupation''s, so it is a pool bonus (bonuses.pools.sdc), never sdc_base, and men_of_arms: false as for a race (the Arkhon R.C.C. reading in this book). Hit points P.E. x2 plus 1D6 per level. M.D.C.: by armor or psionic power only, a restriction line; no mdc_base. P.P.E. 2D4. Horror Factor 6. || PSIONICS: the book says a powerful psychic and does not name a tier; stored as master (judgement), because its own powers (dimensional Rifting, closing Rifts, time warp) are super-psionic in scale and its per-level gains are barred only from Super, the shape of a master psionic. Two powers each from Healing, Sensitive and Physical as three starting groups, then one per level after the first from any category except Super: powers_per_level 1 under categories_allowed Healing, Sensitive and Physical (Phase and Mind Bleeder powers are not offered - judgement; they are other races'' categories). I.S.P. 3D6x10 plus M.E., +10 per additional level. The four page powers are special abilities with their I.S.P. costs, not catalog psionics; the dimensional powers'' level gates are in their text. || BONUSES: +1 save vs magic (spell_magic), +4 vs Horror Factor, unconditional. The Time Warp and Psi-Wave modifiers are conditional and prose. || SKILLS: Language and Literacy: Spanish (98%) is Language: Spanish 98 plus Literacy: Native Language 98. Languages two of choice +15 as two picks from Quechua, Aymara or Language: Other. Radio Basic is Radio: Basic 45+10 = 55. Demon and Monster Lore is Lore: Demons & Monsters 25+15 = 40. Wilderness Survival 30+5 = 35. Holistic Medicine 20+10 = 30. W.P. Energy Rifle plus one W.P. of choice. Hand to Hand: Basic to Expert for one other skill, Martial Arts for two; the book offers no Assassin. || RELATED: six, plus two at level 3 and one at 5, 8, 11 and 14 (the book says new skills start at first level proficiency). Communications, Domestic and Pilot Related +5; Medical, Science and Technical +10; Espionage Detect Ambush and Track Humans (Tracking (people)) only; Physical any except Acrobatics; Electrical, Mechanical, Military, Pilot, Rogue, W.P. and Wilderness any. Horsemanship granted because Pilot is Any (the flying-tiger precedent). Secondary: four, same limits without bonuses. || EQUIPMENT: the serpentoid''s kit plus an herbal medicine first-aid kit (first-aid-kit). The ''light striker laser rifle'' is described nowhere in the book, so the choice pairs the equalizer-combat-shotgun with the lightbringer-laser-rifle (judgement); energy sidearm of choice is a choice led by the ip-7-ion-pistol; four reloads/E-clips per weapon as e-clip x4 for the sidearm, the long gun''s four in prose; customizable-armor (M.D.C. 75); hand radio as walkie-talkie; gas mask, survival kit, bedroll, one week''s rations and survival knife. || MONEY: 3D4x100 credits. || Alliances (Prometheans, temporal raiders, True Atlanteans respect the species) are lore. Cybernetics: no line printed; nothing stored."
